From: koalabuttz <27229333+koalabuttz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 04:15:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: draw the flashbang white-out and concussion blur in
 multiplayer

clientViewParamsArray had no initializer in multiplayer, so the
shellshock screen effects sized their quads from a 0x0 rectangle. The
camera shook but the screen never went white or blurred.

Initialize it to the full screen, as cg_view.cpp does for singleplayer.
---
 src/cgame_mp/cg_view_mp.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/cgame_mp/cg_view_mp.cpp b/src/cgame_mp/cg_view_mp.cpp
index 3b507a1a..43b71bf7 100644
--- a/src/cgame_mp/cg_view_mp.cpp
+++ b/src/cgame_mp/cg_view_mp.cpp
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
 #include <game_mp/g_main_mp.h>
 
 TestEffect s_testEffect[1];
-ClientViewParams clientViewParamsArray[1][1];
+ClientViewParams clientViewParamsArray[1][1] = { { { 0.0f, 0.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f } } }; // full screen, as in SP
 
 const dvar_t *cg_heliKillCamDist;
 const dvar_t *cg_heliKillCamFov;
